SUMMARY:Psalms: Ancient Text\, Present Tense
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T131500
UID:tribe-10004477@nertamid.org
DESCRIPTION:For thousands of years\, people have turned to the Book of Psa
 lms in order to find something of themselves within its ancient words\, an
  articulation of a feeling that they had not yet managed to formulate. How
  does that work? And more importantly\, what does that feel like? Join Rab
 bi James Feder at noon for a monthly study of one our most well-worn colle
 ctions. No previous experience is necessary.Dates: 10/18\, 11/15\, 12/20\,
  1/24\, 2/28\, 3/7\, 4/18Register Here
